WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.028
This is the room where I sleep.

2
00:00:12.029 --> 00:00:20.983
I sleep in the bedroom.

3
00:00:20.984 --> 00:00:24.530
This is the room where I brush my teeth.

4
00:00:24.531 --> 00:00:34.131
I brush my teeth in the bathroom.

5
00:00:34.132 --> 00:00:37.011
This is the room where I cook.

6
00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:45.558
I cook in the kitchen.

7
00:00:45.559 --> 00:00:48.574
This is the room where I eat.

8
00:00:48.575 --> 00:00:58.211
I eat in the dining room.

9
00:00:58.212 --> 00:01:02.418
This is the room where I talk with my family.

10
00:01:02.419 --> 00:01:13.214
I talk with my family in the living room.

11
00:01:13.215 --> 00:01:17.207
This is the area where we park our car.

12
00:01:17.208 --> 00:01:27.324
We park the car in the garage.

13
00:01:27.325 --> 00:01:30.609
This is the area where I play.

14
00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:39.944
I play in the yard.

15
00:01:39.945 --> 00:01:43.897
This is my house, where I live with my family.

16
00:01:43.898 --> 00:01:49.864
"Home sweet home!"
